,{"dealId":9818},{"dealId":9819},{"dealId":9820},{"dealId":9821}],"note":"<p>During the White Meadow Crisis, when the Kindom of Shiasikal splintered, the Human Inquiry, a group interested in gathering and hoarding as much knowledge as possible took control of the local armies and created the Dewgrian Protectorate. The protectorate is led by an individual named: Grand Lord of the Uncany, which is chosen and constantly guided by the Council of the White Flame. The political power is funeled by a variety of groups that each focuses on different aspects of the knowledge they gather.</p>\n<p>The capital Olsbach, contains a great library and several research guilds:</p>\n<p>Ravenskulls - This guild is specializes in researching avian life forms in all their variety;</p>\n<p>Bound War - This guild is responsible for developing new war tacticts, spells and battle constructs;</p>\n<p>Angels of the Pristine - Is a semireligious guild, that seeks to find out everything there is to know abut the gods, whichever they may be;</p>\n<p>Fortune of the World - Is the guild that focuses archeological and paleontological knowledge that can be gathered.</p>\n<p>These guilds are all vying for power and influence for the funding from the protectorate and the chance to perform as many missions for knowledge gathering, as possible.</p>\n<p>Olsbach's main income comes from tourism and information selling, as well as research contracts for other cities or kindoms, especially the war research.</p>\n<p>The citadel houses the Grand Lord of the Uncany and its council, as well as the large library famous for its contents.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"cell":2174,"x":3500.54,"y":1273.58,"state":4,"i":88,"culture":7,"name":"Curunsi","feature":2,"capital":1,"port":1,"population":29.056,"type":"Naval","coa":{"t1":"or","charges":[{"charge":"wolfHeadErased","t":"purpure","p":"e","t2":"purpure","size":1.5}],"shield":"fantasy5"},"citadel":1,"plaza":1,"walls":1,"shanty":1,"temple":0,"group":"cities","lock":false,